{
  "name": "CreateMessage",
  "summary": "下发设备消息",
  "tags": "设备消息",
  "productshort": "IoTDA",
  "region_id": "af-south-1",
  "paths": {
    "/v5/iot/{project_id}/devices/{device_id}/messages": {
      "post": {
        "tags": [
          "MessageManagement"
        ],
        "summary": "下发设备消息",
        "description": "物联网平台可向设备下发消息,应用服务器可调用此接口向指定设备下发消息,以实现对设备的控制。应用将消息下发给平台后,平台返回应用响应结果,平台再将消息发送给设备。平台返回应用响应结果不一定是设备接收结果,建议用户应用通过订阅[设备消息状态变更通知](https://support.huaweicloud.com/api-iothub/iot_06_v5_01203.html),订阅后平台会将设备接收结果推送给订阅的应用。\n注意:\n- 此接口适用于MQTT设备消息下发,暂不支持其他协议接入的设备消息下发。\n- 此接口仅支持单个设备消息下发,如需多个设备消息下发,请参见 [创建批量任务](https://support.huaweicloud.com/api-iothub/iot_06_v5_0045.html)。",
        "operationId": "CreateMessage",
        "consumes": [
          "application/json"
        ],
        "produces": [
          "application/json"
        ],
        "parameters": [
          {
            "name": "project_id",
            "in": "path",
            "description": "**参数说明**:项目ID。获取方法请参见 [获取项目ID](https://support.huaweicloud.com/api-iothub/iot_06_v5_1001.html) 。",
            "required": true,
            "type": "string",
            "pattern": "^[a-fA-F0-9]{1,32}$",
            "x-example": "2b31ed520xxxxxxebedb6e57xxxxxxxx"
          },
          {
            "name": "device_id",
            "in": "path",
            "description": "**参数说明**:下发消息的设备ID,用于唯一标识一个设备,在注册设备时由物联网平台分配获得。\n**取值范围**:长度不超过128,只允许字母、数字、下划线(_)、连接符(-)的组合。",
            "required": true,
            "type": "string",
            "pattern": "^[a-zA-Z0-9_-]{1,128}$"
          },
          {
            "name": "Instance-Id",
            "in": "header",
            "description": "**参数说明**:实例ID。物理多租下各实例的唯一标识,建议携带该参数,在使用专业版时必须携带该参数。您可以在IoTDA管理控制台界面,选择左侧导航栏“总览”页签查看当前实例的ID,具体获取方式请参考[查看实例详情](https://support.huaweicloud.com/usermanual-iothub/iot_01_0121.html) 。",
            "required": false,
            "type": "string",
            "pattern": "[0-9a-f-]{1,36}",
            "x-example": "1a7ffc5c-d89c-44dd-8265-b1653d951ce0"
          },
          {
            "in": "body",
            "name": "CreateMessageRequestBody",
            "description": "请求结构体,见请求结构体说明",
            "required": true,
            "schema": {
              "$ref": "#/definitions/DeviceMessageRequest"
            }
          }
        ],
        "responses": {
          "201": {
            "description": "Created",
            "examples": {
              "application/json": {
                "message_id": "b1224afb-e9f0-4916-8220-b6bab568e888",
                "result": {
                  "status": "PENDING",
                  "created_time": "20151212T121212Z",
                  "finished_time": "20151212T121213Z"
                }
              }
            },
            "schema": {
              "$ref": "#/definitions/DeviceMessageResponse"
            },
            "x-SuccessCode": true
          },
          "400": {
            "description": "Bad Request",
            "x-Error": [
              "IOTDA.014130",
              "IOTDA.014150",
              "IOTDA.014151"
            ]
          },
          "403": {
            "description": "Forbidden",
            "x-Error": [
              "IOTDA.000021",
              "IOTDA.001006",
              "IOTDA.000022",
              "IOTDA.014018"
            ]
          },
          "404": {
            "description": "Not Found",
            "x-Error": [
              "IOTDA.014000"
            ]
          },
          "500": {
            "description": "Internal Server Error",
            "x-Error": [
              "IOTDA.000001",
              "IOTDA.000020"
            ]
          }
        },
        "x-support-sdk": "Y",
        "x-is-registered": "Y",
        "x-publishpath": "iot_06_v5_0059",
        "x-imports": "org.springframework.http.ResponseEntity;",
        "x-returnType": "ResponseEntity<DeviceMessageResponse>",
        "x-request-examples-description-1": "平台默认topic下发",
        "x-request-examples-text-1": {
          "message_id": "99b32da9-cd17-4cdf-a286-f6e849cbc364",
          "name": "messageName",
          "message": "HelloWorld"
        },
        "x-request-examples-url-2": "POST https://{endpoint}/v5/iot/{project_id}/devices/{device_id}/messages",
        "x-request-examples-description-2": "平台自定义topic下发",
        "x-request-examples-text-2": {
          "message_id": "99b32da9-cd17-4cdf-a286-f6e849cbc364",
          "name": "messageName",
          "message": "HelloWorld",
          "topic": "testTopic"
        },
        "x-request-examples-url-3": "POST https://{endpoint}/v5/iot/{project_id}/devices/{device_id}/messages",
        "x-request-examples-description-3": "自定义topic下发",
        "x-request-examples-text-3": {
          "message_id": "99b32da9-cd17-4cdf-a286-f6e849cbc364",
          "name": "messageName",
          "message": "HelloWorld",
          "topic_full_name": "/test/customTopic/testTopic"
        },
        "x-request-examples-url-1": "POST https://{endpoint}/v5/iot/{project_id}/devices/{device_id}/messages",
        "x-request-examples-1": {
          "message_id": "99b32da9-cd17-4cdf-a286-f6e849cbc364",
          "name": "messageName",
          "message": "HelloWorld"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "definitions": {
    "DeviceMessageRequest": {
      "type": "object",
      "required": [
        "message"
      ],
      "properties": {
        "message_id": {
          "type": "string",
          "example": "99b32da9-cd17-4cdf-a286-f6e849cbc364",
          "description": "**参数说明**:消息id,由用户生成(推荐使用UUID),同一个设备下唯一, 如果用户填写的id在设备下不唯一, 则接口返回错误。\n**取值范围**:长度不超过100,只允许字母、数字、下划线(_)、连接符(-)的组合。",
          "maxLength": 128,
          "pattern": "^[\\一-\\龥a-zA-Z0-9_?'#()\\.,&%@!-]*$"
        },
        "name": {
          "type": "string",
          "example": "messageName",
          "description": "**参数说明**:消息名称。\n**取值范围**:长度不超过128,只允许中文、字母、数字、以及_?'#().,&%@!-等字符的组合。",
          "maxLength": 128,
          "pattern": "^[\\一-\\龥a-zA-Z0-9_?'#()\\.,&%@!-]*$"
        },
        "message": {
          "type": "object",
          "example": "HelloWorld",
          "description": "**参数说明**:消息内容,支持string和json格式。",
          "properties": {}
        },
        "properties": {
          "description": "**参数说明**:消息下行到设备的属性参数。",
          "$ref": "#/definitions/PropertiesDTO"
        },
        "encoding": {
          "type": "string",
          "example": "none",
          "description": "**参数说明**:消息内容编码格式。默认值none。\n**取值范围**:\n- none \n- base64",
          "pattern": "(none|base64)",
          "default": "none"
        },
        "payload_format": {
          "type": "string",
          "example": "standard",
          "description": "**参数说明**:有效负载格式,在消息内容编码格式为none时有效。默认值standard(平台封装的标准格式)。\n**取值范围**:\n- standard \n- raw:直接将消息内容作为有效负载下发。",
          "pattern": "(standard|raw)",
          "default": "standard"
        },
        "topic": {
          "type": "string",
          "example": "messageDown",
          "description": "**参数说明**:消息下行到设备的自定义topic后缀, 可选, 仅适用于MQTT协议接入的设备。 用户只能填写在租户产品界面配置的topic, 否则会校验不通过。 平台给消息topic添加的前缀为$oc/devices/{device_id}/user/, 用户可以在前缀的基础上增加自定义部分, 如增加messageDown,则平台拼接前缀后完整的topic为 $oc/devices/{device_id}/user/messageDown,其中device_id以实际设备的网关id替代。 如果用户指定该topic,消息会通过该topic下行到设备,如果用户不指定, 则消息通过系统默认的topic下行到设备,系统默认的topic格式为: $oc/devices/{device_id}/sys/messages/down。此字段与topic_full_name字段只可填写一个。",
          "maxLength": 128
        },
        "topic_full_name": {
          "type": "string",
          "example": "/device/message/down",
          "description": "**参数说明**:消息下行到设备的完整topic名称, 可选。用户需要下发用户自定义的topic给设备时,可以使用该参数指定完整的topic名称,物联网平台不校验该topic是否在平台定义,直接透传给设备。设备需要提前订阅该topic。此字段与topic字段只可填写一个。",
          "maxLength": 128,
          "pattern": "^([$/]?[a-zA-Z0-9(),\\-.:=@;_!*'%?+]*)([a-zA-Z0-9(),\\-.:=@;_!*'%?+]+/)*([a-zA-Z0-9(),\\-.:=@;_!*'%?+]*|#)$"
        },
        "ttl": {
          "type": "integer",
          "format": "int32",
          "example": 1440,
          "description": "**参数说明**:下发消息在平台缓存的老化时间,时间单位是分钟,默认值1440;ttl参数数值必须是5的倍数,即以5分钟为粒度;指定为0时表示不缓存消息,最大缓存时间1440分钟,即缓存一天",
          "minimum": 0,
          "maximum": 10080
        }
      },
      "title": "DeviceMessageRequest 创建设备消息的请求对象"
    },
    "MessageResult": {
      "type": "object",
      "properties": {
        "status": {
          "type": "string",
          "example": "PENDING",
          "description": "消息状态, PENDING,DELIVERED,FAILED和TIMEOUT。如果设备不在线,则平台缓存消息,并且返回PENDING,等设备数据上报之后再下发;如果设备在线,则消息直接进行下发,下发成功后接口返回DELIVERED,失败返回FAILED;如果消息在平台默认时间内(1天)还没有下发给设备,则平台会将消息设置为超时,状态为TIMEOUT。另外应用可以订阅消息的执行结果,平台会将消息结果推送给订阅的应用。"
        },
        "created_time": {
          "type": "string",
          "example": "20151212T121212Z",
          "description": "消息的创建时间,\"yyyyMMdd'T'HHmmss'Z'\"格式的UTC字符串。"
        },
        "finished_time": {
          "type": "string",
          "example": "20151212T121213Z",
          "description": "消息结束时间, \"yyyyMMdd'T'HHmmss'Z'\"格式的UTC字符串,包含消息转换到DELIVERED,FAILED和TIMEOUT状态的时间。"
        }
      },
      "description": "下发的消息响应结果"
    },
    "DeviceMessageResponse": {
      "type": "object",
      "properties": {
        "message_id": {
          "type": "string",
          "example": "b1224afb-e9f0-4916-8220-b6bab568e888",
          "description": "消息id,由用户生成(推荐使用UUID),同一个设备下唯一, 如果用户不填写,则由物联网平台生成。"
        },
        "result": {
          "description": "消息下发结果。Json格式。",
          "$ref": "#/definitions/MessageResult"
        }
      },
      "title": "DeviceMessageResponse 创建设备消息返回结构体V5"
    },
    "PropertiesDTO": {
      "type": "object",
      "properties": {
        "correlation_data": {
          "type": "string",
          "example": "d4922d8a-6c8e-4396-852c-164aefa6638q",
          "description": "**参数说明**:MQTT 5.0版本请求和响应模式中的相关数据,可选。用户可以通过该参数配置MQTT协议请求和响应模式中的相关数据。\n**取值范围**:长度不超过128,只允许字母、数字、下划线(_)、连接符(-)的组合。",
          "pattern": "^[a-zA-Z0-9_-]{0,128}$"
        },
        "response_topic": {
          "type": "string",
          "example": "/device/message/response",
          "description": "**参数说明**:MQTT 5.0版本请求和响应模式中的响应主题,可选。用户可以通过该参数配置MQTT协议请求和响应模式中的响应主题。\n**取值范围**:长度不超过128, 只允许字母、数字、以及_-?=$#+/等字符的组合。",
          "maxLength": 128,
          "pattern": "^[a-zA-Z0-9_?=$#+/-]{0,128}$"
        },
        "user_properties": {
          "type": "array",
          "description": "**参数说明**:用户自定义属性,可选。用户可以通过该参数配置用户自定义属性。可以配置的最大自定义属性数量为20。",
          "items": {
            "$ref": "#/definitions/UserPropDTO"
          },
          "x-maxLength": 20,
          "x-minLength": 0
        }
      },
      "title": "属性数据结构体",
      "description": "属性数据",
      "x-imports": "java.util.List"
    },
    "UserPropDTO": {
      "type": "object",
      "properties": {
        "prop_key": {
          "type": "string",
          "example": "propKey1",
          "description": "**参数说明**:用户自定义属性键。\n**取值范围**:长度不超过128,只允许字母、数字、下划线(_)、连接符(-)的组合。",
          "pattern": "^[a-zA-Z0-9_-]{0,128}$"
        },
        "prop_value": {
          "type": "string",
          "example": "propValue1",
          "description": "**参数说明**:用户自定义属性值。\n**取值范围**:长度不超过128,只允许中文、字母、数字、以及_? '#().,&%@!-等字符的组合。",
          "pattern": "^[\\一-\\龥a-zA-Z0-9_?'#()\\.,&%@!-]{0,128}$"
        }
      },
      "title": "用户自定义属性结构体",
      "description": "用户自定义属性"
    }
  },
  "version": "2.0",
  "parameters": {},
  "host": "iotda.af-south-1.myhuaweicloud.com",
  "base_path": null,
  "info_version": "v5",
  "method": "post",
  "uri": null
}